{"channelId":"UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","row":["Canham Farm Horse Rescue",14,"Canham Farm Horse Rescue Exists:\n\nTo retrain horses to have a useful and respected life\nTo ensure the horse is matched correctly with his or her new sponsor/owner.\nTo give ongoing support and advice on all aspects of equine care and re-settlement.\nTo support and commit to the welfare of all horses\nTo provide education and training courses for people wanting to learn about keeping, training and rehabilitating horses\nEducating People to Interact Successfully With Horses\n\nHorses can be complicated and confusing. There are so many things to learn and remember, and so much often conflicting information available, that it can be difficult to know where to turn. We are here to help and would far prefer an owner to ask if they are not sure about something. This could be anything, from knowing how to help a new horse settle in, to admitting that you’re struggling to cope.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:41.534Z","channelId":"UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"3e97e9280500e3720439228bdb4e240638912b8e32ffcc8716cd53edd5dd5e12","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7a655111ed098b4378855932cd97da6caa2643f6a373f55cc51127bb43786940"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":14,"raw":"14 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBMKi6nOdamVHJxyQWjZo7g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:41.534Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简